Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 11:29:54 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 24/58] Guide: frame base, blade and ring of light placed by
 hudbkgnd's keyframes

The Guide's frame pieces now move by their own keyframes (hud_keys.txt,
evaluated with xam's easing) at the HUD's current frame, instead of whole
frame images slid by one distance:
- full <-> half slides: base and blade move by their own amounts (-409 /
  -407.5), so the blade no longer jumps 1.5 units at the end;
- the ring of light is a layer of its own, as in hudbkgnd: hidden while the
  Guide slides open and fading in at the end (30-44), resting at 618 after
  ClosedToHalf but 617 after FullToHalf / ErrorToHalf, 1025 after
  ClosedToFull but 1026 after HalfToFull.
The page images no longer contain it (the asset generators hide ROL).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AFb8CDFE1Ms5NnJH88eG8b
